[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605533416","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101887#issuecomment-2605533416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101887","id":2605533416,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bTUjo","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T19:09:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T19:09:33Z","body":"Is a regression between 4.4 dev4 and dev 5, i'll bisect.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605533416/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605669005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101887#issuecomment-2605669005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101887","id":2605669005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bT1qN","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T20:25:37Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T20:25:37Z","body":"Bisected to #98625\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f782fa96-d261-40f0-8aad-bd9046c600fb)\n\n<br>\n\nFrom the pr that caused this regression the problem seems the mrp code adding the same point in the `Line2D` node, because the issue only happens when you don't move the mouse so the `queue` array will be filled with the same position and this will be passed to the `Line2D` node so for now i will not ping the pr author. A simple fix for that is only add points that wasn't added before like this:\n\n```\nextends Line2D\n\nvar queue : Array\n\nfunc _physics_process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tvar pos = get_global_mouse_position()\n\t\n\tqueue.push_front(pos)\n\t\n\tif queue.size() > 25:\n\t\tqueue.pop_back()\n\t\n\tclear_points()\n\t\n\tfor point in queue:\n\t\tif points.has(point) == false:\n\t\t\tadd_point(point)\n\n```\n\n<br>\n\n@AThousandShips I don't think this is a regression, just a bad code that was invalidated for avoid bigger problems, so i let in your hands if the pr author should be pinged about that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605669005/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605676168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101887#issuecomment-2605676168","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101887","id":2605676168,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bT3aI","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T20:29:47Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T20:32:38Z","body":"That's a very valid point, but at minimum this needs to be documented *if* it is intentional, but the validity of this should also be discussed further, as it is not really obvious, even with documentation\n\nSo at minimum this should be documented, but we might want to build in some kind of function for this instead\n\nNote that this change was done to prevent a crash in `Curve3D`, but unsure if the effects on `Line2D` were intentional\n\nCC @KoBeWi any thoughts?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605676168/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605924756","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101887#issuecomment-2605924756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101887","id":2605924756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bU0GU","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T23:08:22Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T23:08:22Z","body":"The error is probably coming from here:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a7146ef807a7676f51a8a63cf4441ad647f4be66/scene/2d/line_builder.cpp#L192\nLineBuilder may divide by 0.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605924756/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647859893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101887#issuecomment-2647859893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101887","id":2647859893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d0yK1","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T12:34:42Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T12:34:42Z","body":"Then it's likely a pre-existing bug that dates back to #28565... the recent changes just make the error explicit.\n\nThe LineBuilder logic indeed only computes `total_distance` conditionally, but it's then used throughout leading to multiple potential divisions by zero.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comm